            "description": "Creates a new customer. Requires ADMIN or SALES role.\n\nRequired fields: name, mobile, businessName, customerType, address\nOptional fields: email, gstNumber, status (default LEAD), followUpDate, notes\n\ncustomerType: RETAIL | WHOLESALE | DISTRIBUTOR\nstatus: LEAD | ACTIVE | INACTIVE"
